## Decision Trees

### Where to Add Code

```
├─ Locator     → TSAP/Pages/{Module}/{feature}-page.js constructor
├─ Page method → TSAP/Pages/{Module}/{feature}-page.js
├─ Shared util → TSAP/Shared_Functions/common-functions.js
├─ Test spec   → TSAP/Tests/WebApp_Testing/{Module}_Test_Cases/
├─ Test data   → TSAP/Data/Resources/constants.js
└─ API helper  → Use APIActions from framework
```

### Which Wait

(See `TSAP/Pages/function-rules.md` for API reference)

```
├─ Page navigation → PwActions.waitForNetworkIdle(page)
├─ DOM ready       → PwActions.waitForDOMContentLoaded(page)
├─ Element visible → PwActions.waitTillVisible(page, locator)
├─ Element gone    → PwActions.waitTillElementDisappear(page, locator)
└─ Known animation → CommonUtils.sleep(seconds) — document reason
```

